<title>USA: ASARCO's September lead premium at 7.5 cts.</title>
<headline>ASARCO's September lead premium at 7.5 cts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASARCO said its lead premium over LME cash for September was 7.5 cents per pound, unchanged from August.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
